---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Ava from '@src/assets/img/amanullah.jpg';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title='About Me' description='Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet'>
	<div class='container'>
		<main class='prose text-lg dark:prose-invert'>
			<article>
				<div class='w-full md:flex md:items-center gap-16 mb-10'>
					<div class='text-pretty leading-9'>
						<h1 class='text-4xl font-bold mb-4'>Hi 👋, Aman Here!</h1>
						<Prose>
							<div class='text-lg'>
								<p>
									🚀 I’m a <strong>full-stack software engineer</strong> and the <strong
										>Director of Engineering at <a href='https://bushwickdigital.com'>Bushwick Digital</a></strong
									>. With over a decade of experience, I have worked with startups and scale-ups, helping them build, optimize, and scale
									their digital products. My passion lies in developing high-performance applications, solving complex technical challenges,
									and creating seamless user experiences.
								</p>
							</div>
						</Prose>
					</div>
					<Image src={Ava} alt='Muhammad Syakirurohman' width={300} class='rounded-3xl rotate-3 mx-4 md:mx-0' />
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3 class='text-3xl font-bold mb-4'>My Journey</h3>
					<p>
						From the early days of coding to leading engineering teams, my career has been a mix of hands-on development and strategic
						problem-solving. Over the years, I’ve worn many hats—developer, architect, and technical lead—allowing me to approach challenges
						from multiple perspectives. Whether it’s <strong
							>building scalable applications, automating workflows, or streamlining deployments</strong
						>, I thrive in environments that require innovation and efficiency.
					</p>

					<h3 class='text-3xl font-bold mb-4'>What I Do</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>
							💡 <strong>Full-Stack Development:</strong> I work across the entire tech stack, specializing in <strong
								>React, WordPress, and modern web architectures</strong
							> to build scalable and maintainable solutions.
						</li>
						<li>
							🛠️ <strong>DevOps & Cloud:</strong> I focus on <strong>cloud infrastructure, automation, and CI/CD pipelines</strong>,
							ensuring applications run efficiently and scale effortlessly.
						</li>
						<li>
							📊 <strong>Data & Performance Optimization:</strong> From designing <strong>efficient databases</strong> to implementing <strong
								>performance optimizations</strong
							>, I ensure every system is built for speed and reliability.
						</li>
						<li>
							🔍 <strong>Problem-Solving Mindset:</strong> Whether it’s debugging complex systems or architecting new solutions, I bring a <strong
								>strategic and detail-oriented approach</strong
							> to engineering.
						</li>
					</ul>
					<h3 class='text-3xl font-bold mb-4'>My Philosophy</h3>
					<p>
						I believe that <strong>great software isn’t just about writing code—it’s about solving real-world problems</strong>. I
						prioritize <strong>clean, maintainable code</strong>, accessibility, and user-first design. My goal is to build <strong
							>products that not only work efficiently but also create impact</strong
						>.
					</p>

					<h3 class='text-3xl font-bold mb-4'>Let’s Connect!</h3>
					<p>
						If you’re interested in collaborating, feel free to reach out! I’m always open to discussing new projects, exchanging ideas, and
						learning from fellow developers. 🚀
					</p>

					<p><a href='mailto:aman@bushwickdigital.com'>aman[@]bushwickdigital.com</a></p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</main>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
